    "created_at": "2017-04-26T20:38:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-26T20:38:11Z",
    "body": "> that doesnt work because if french person typed the accent the it wouldn't recognize it.\r\n\r\nBrowsers are advised to consult both the label and the value when searching. So you can use the label for a accented version and the value for the accent-less version, and in browsers that follow the spec's UI recommendations, that will work.\r\n\r\nClosing since this is mostly out of scope (UI concerns), but to the extent the spec does recommend UI, it already recommends a UI that can solve this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
